{"resourceIdentifier":"3123","resourceName":"EMIN BIOGAS PP KIRSEHIR","description":"Emin Biogas PP Kırsehir project (hereafter referred to as the project) is a biogas to-energy project that will generate renewable energy by capturing biogas from animal manure -via anaerobic digestion- and utilizing it to produce thermal and electric energy through biogas systems. The project is being implemented by EMİN BİYOGAZ ENERJİ ÜRETİM SANAYİ VE TİCARET ANONİM ŞİRKETİ, as the Project Owner, in Cugun village, Korpinar district, Kırsehir province, in Turkey. The proposed project activity has two biogas engines installed at the biogas power plant, with 3.002 MWe/h. The manure\r\nproduced by 42760 cattle neighboring farms is collected and fed into the anaerobic digesters at the project site. According to Electricity Generation License, the biogas generator system has the maximum operational capacity 3.002 MWe/h. The annual feed-in electricity is estimated to be 21,014,000 kWh. While heat generated at the plant is used at the facility to warm the digesters, the electricity generated is directly fed to the national grid. The expected average annual emission reductions are 394,799 tCO2eq/y. Accordingly, the project is expected to generate 2,763,593 tCO2eq emissions reduction during the first crediting period and 8,290,779 tCO2eq emissions reduction throughout its three crediting periods for a total of 21 years.","location":{"latitude":39.200539,"longitude":34.095337},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-22","endExclusive":"2022-09-22","endInclusive":"2022-09-21"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3123"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"157527"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Earthood Services Limited"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"14/02/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 28/08/2020 - 27/08/2027"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=65665&IDKEY=llksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098o90552035","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Emin Biogas Kirsehir PP_Joint PDMR.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-04-28T13:06:30.29Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=65554&IDKEY=a903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdf090398966","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS Listing Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-04-27T11:23:07.903Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=127547&IDKEY=3iofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3175887313","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS JPDMR 3123 02AUG2020-31DEC2021_round 3_clean (1).pdf","uploadDate":"2025-02-14T21:47:09.58Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=107367&IDKEY=u8723kjnf7kjandsaslmdv09887vaksmrmnwqkjoiuanfnfuq0f148059093","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"VCS_Registration_Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-02-09T15:13:20.173Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=127549&IDKEY=f98klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d8175